---
// Key 4: major or minor. Without a script there is only the rule.
---

<div class="tool" data-quiz-tool>
  <ul class="rule">
    <li>Major: whole, whole, half, whole, whole, whole, half.</li>
    <li>Natural minor: whole, half, whole, whole, half, whole, whole.</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="controls needs-js">
    <button type="button" class="btn fill" data-quiz-play>Play a scale</button>
    <button type="button" class="pick" aria-pressed="false" data-quiz-guess="major">Major</button>
    <button type="button" class="pick" aria-pressed="false" data-quiz-guess="minor">Minor</button>
  </div>
  <p class="status needs-js" aria-live="polite" data-quiz-status>Press play, listen, then choose. Turn the sound on first.</p>
  <p class="score needs-js" data-quiz-score>Right 0, wrong 0.</p>
</div>
